WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.300 --> 00:00:02.868
-Welcome, welcome, welcome,
welcome to

00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:03.968
"The Tonight Show" everyone.

00:00:03.968 --> 00:00:05.367
You're here. You made it.

00:00:05.367 --> 00:00:07.067
Thank you for watching at home.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:08.200
Let's get to some news.

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.868
Well guys,
last night in Chicago,

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:11.834
President Biden
spoke at a fundraiser,

00:00:11.834 --> 00:00:13.834
and he decided to kick it off
with a shout-out

00:00:13.834 --> 00:00:15.634
to his home state of Delaware.

00:00:15.634 --> 00:00:17.634
Let's see how that went.

00:00:17.634 --> 00:00:19.400
-Is Delaware in the house?

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.400
Anybody from Delaware?

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:23.133
[ Light cheering ]

00:00:23.133 --> 00:00:24.834
Holler loudly, man.

00:00:24.834 --> 00:00:26.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.601 --> 00:00:33.901
-That's the equivalent of
a drummer tossing his drumsticks

00:00:33.901 --> 00:00:35.734
into the crowd and then hearing
them hit the ground like,

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.434
"Click, click, click."

00:00:37.434 --> 00:00:39.567
[ Drumsticks clack ]
Yeah, exactly.

00:00:39.567 --> 00:00:41.667
[ As Biden ]
Is Delaware in the...

00:00:41.667 --> 00:00:43.167
[ Normal voice ]
Is Delaware in the house?

00:00:43.167 --> 00:00:44.234
-Oh!

00:00:44.234 --> 00:00:47.067
-Who is he? DJ Jazzy Scooter?

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:49.801
But today,
Biden was back in Washington,

00:00:49.801 --> 00:00:53.601
where he hosted a -- co-hosted
a virtual COVID summit.

00:00:53.601 --> 00:00:55.701
Yep. And The fact that
the summit was held virtually

00:00:55.701 --> 00:00:57.000
pretty much tells you
how we're doing

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:00.901
in the fight against COVID.

00:01:00.901 --> 00:01:02.534
The U.S. co-hosted a summit with

00:01:02.534 --> 00:01:05.501
Germany, Indonesia, Senegal,
and Belize.

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:07.300
Good, all the heavy hitters
are in on this.

00:01:08.801 --> 00:01:10.868
But Biden is serious about
tackling the pandemic.

00:01:10.868 --> 00:01:12.767
That's why, today, he announced
the new head of his

00:01:12.767 --> 00:01:14.701
COVID task force, Patti LuPone.

00:01:22.634 --> 00:01:25.434
-Oh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:25.434 --> 00:01:27.067
Yeah!

00:01:30.567 --> 00:01:32.067
-Hey, listen to this guys.

00:01:32.067 --> 00:01:35.300
Moderna has fired their new CFO
after just one day on the job.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.901
Yep, they thought
he was Moderna quality,

00:01:37.901 --> 00:01:40.934
but it turns out he was more of
Johnson &amp; Johnson material.

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:43.801
Fired on day one.

00:01:43.801 --> 00:01:45.400
He basically walked in with
a box of his things

00:01:45.400 --> 00:01:47.400
