I spent with all of you."

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:55.567
Apparently, the boss walked in
on him lying back in his chair,

00:01:55.567 --> 00:01:57.767
tossing syringes up, trying to
get them stuck in the ceiling.

00:02:00.167 --> 00:02:04.334
His LinkedIn profile now says,
"Start date: May 9, 2022.

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:06.834
End date: lunchtime."

00:02:06.834 --> 00:02:08.400
Hey, guys, this is big.

00:02:08.400 --> 00:02:11.334
Astronomers just revealed
the first image of a black hole,

00:02:11.334 --> 00:02:13.133
the black hole
in the center of our galaxy.

00:02:13.133 --> 00:02:15.300
Look at this. Check this out.
-Ooh!

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:17.501
