hole or someone ate a Cheeto

00:02:17.501 --> 00:02:19.567
and touched the telescope lens.

00:02:19.567 --> 00:02:22.868
Well, guys, it's been a rough
week for the stock market,

00:02:22.868 --> 00:02:26.400
