00:02:57.167 --> 00:02:58.234
-[ High-pitched ] I have, Doug.

00:02:58.234 --> 00:03:00.467
And even though this is
Party City,

00:03:00.467 --> 00:03:02.834
these numbers do not
make me want to party.

00:03:02.834 --> 00:03:06.634
-Yep. This is what happens to
your business with inflation.

00:03:06.634 --> 00:03:08.934
