while it lasted.

00:03:13.901 --> 00:03:14.901
[ Hissing ]

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:16.667
[ Squeaking ]

00:03:16.667 --> 00:03:17.701
[ Hissing stops ]

00:03:17.701 --> 00:03:18.968
-[ Deeply ]
I'm gonna miss you, bro.

00:03:18.968 --> 00:03:20.501
-[ Deeply ] You too.

00:03:20.501 --> 00:03:21.534
John, don't!

00:03:23.234 --> 00:03:25.234
